WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.700
Narrator: Faisal steps into his view and waves gently.

2
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:07.200
Narrator: He shows him the screen and the exit, then writes for him in his notepad.

3
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:11.000
Narrator: The fan understands and walks with the others to the exit.

4
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.700
Narrator: Show him. Don't shout.

